sentences.l:
for not, I think, will you escape the notice of the earth-shaker,
who resentment has put in his heart,
enraged because his dear son you blinded.

But you yourself, even if you escape,
late and in evil case will you come home, having lost all your companions,
on a ship of another;

And death for you yourself out of the salt-sea
mild, of such a kind, shall come, that shall slay you
under sleek old age worn down;

And your fine prize no one yet holds, but undisturbed
Telemachus the domains enjoys, and the equal feasts
feasts on, which it is fitting a justice-tending man to provide;
